=== path calls as operands
(() => { const o = {a: [], b: [1]}; return o.a.push(1) + o.b.push(2) * 10; })()
--- value
21

=== a path call in a template
(() => { const o = {xs: ["a"]}; return `${o.xs.push("b")}:${o.xs.join("")}`; })()
--- value
