=== a path call returned
(() => { const o = {xs: [1, 2]}; return o.xs.pop(); })()
--- value
2

=== a path call as an arrow's body
(o => o.xs.push(4))({xs: [1]})
--- value
2

=== a path call as a test
(() => { const o = {s: new Set([1])}; return o.s.delete(1) ? "had" : "had not"; })()
--- value
