=== a path call in an argument of another call
(() => { const o = {xs: [3]}; return Math.max(o.xs.push(5), 1); })()
--- value
2

=== a path call in an if
(c => { const o = {xs: []}; if (c) o.xs.push(1); else o.xs.push(2); return o; })(false)
--- value
